,"bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["言归正传，前面的部分还有不少需要修改的地方。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/bangongshihunan.jpg","choice":[]},"104":{"step":[[104,105,""]],"type":1,"name":["编辑亨廷","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"523801.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["我刚才是不是跟你提到了麦高芬？","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/bangongshihunan.jpg","choice":[]},"105":{"step":[[105,106,""]],"type":1,"name":["虚构集","","Recoleta","","","","",""],"head_icon":"311401.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["是的，您让我删掉他们聆听内心的声音的桥段——那实际上是牧童的口哨声。至于走出迷宫的方法，则变成了与石柱的互动。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/bangongshihunan.jpg","choice":[]},"106":{"step":[[106,107,""]],"type":1,"name":["虚构集","","Recoleta","","","","",""],"head_icon":"311401.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["可是，在我看来，那根石柱只是一根石柱，它并不代表任何东西。我们为什么非得在故事里跟它互动不可？","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/bangongshihunan.jpg","choice":[]},"107":{"step":[[107,108,""]],"type":1,"name":["编辑亨廷","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"523801.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["是的，它不代表任何东西，但这就是它想要的结果。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/bangongshihunan.jpg","choice":[]},"108":{"step":[[108,109,""]],"type":1,"name":["编辑亨廷","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"523801.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["正如导演希区柯克所说：“在惊悚片中，麦高芬通常是锁链；在间谍片中，麦高芬通常是文件。”","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/bangongshihunan.jpg","choice":[]},"109":{"step":[[109,110,""]],"type":1,"name":["编辑亨廷","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"523801.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["1942年的《北非谍影》就是很好的例子，电影中的通行证就是一个典型的麦高芬，它是推动所有角色行动的核心，但具体的通行证细节对观众并不重要。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/bangongshihunan.jpg","choice":[]},"110":{"step":[[110,111,""]],"type":1,"name":["编辑亨廷","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"523801.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["就像这根石柱——它是叙事的催化剂，但不会真正影响故事的核心主题。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/bangongshihunan.jpg","choice":[]},"111":{"step":[[111,112,""]],"type":1,"name":["虚构集","","Recoleta","","","","",""],"head_icon":"311401.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["我一直以为这个词来自于那位英国作家兼诗人——鲁德亚德·吉普林的小说呢。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/bangongshihunan.jpg","choice":[]},"112":{"step":[[112,113,""]],"type":1,"name":["虚构集","","Recoleta","","","","",""],"head_icon":"311401.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["原来它在电影术语里是这样的含义。噢……我得做一些笔记！","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/bangongshihunan.jpg","choice":[]},"113":{"step":[[113,114,""]],"type":1,"name":["编辑亨廷","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"523801.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["总结来说，我的核心建议是：提示应该来自于最关键性的句子，避免让读者直接越过它们。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/bangongshihunan.jpg","choice":[]},"114":{"step":[[114,115,""]],"type":1,"name":["虚构集","","Recoleta","","","","",""],"head_icon":"311401.png","audio":"612601622","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["好！接下来，我们就该进入这个故事的最终结局了！我已经有了不少修改的好点子！！","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/bangongshihunan.jpg","choice":[]},"115":{"step":[[115,116,""]],"type":1,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["亨廷看了一眼窗外的夜空。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/bangongshihunan.jpg","choice":[]},"116":{"step":[[116,117,""]],"type":1,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["大量的时间在无形中流逝了，就像大树已经被狡黠的鼹鼠啃得千疮百孔。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/bangongshihunan.jpg","choice":[]},"117":{"step":[[117,118,""]],"type":1,"name":["编辑亨廷","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"523801.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["先停下，小天才，时间已经不早了。我说，你的灵感怎么跟脱了缰绳的马一样？","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/bangongshihunan.jpg","choice":[]},"118":{"step":[[118,119,""]],"type":1,"name":["虚构集","","Recoleta","","","","",""],"head_icon":"311401.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["呜……可今天是礼拜五！如果得不到您的建议的话，我就只能等到周一才能预约了。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/bangongshihunan.jpg","choice":[]},"119":{"step":[[119,120,""]],"type":1,"name":["虚构集","","Recoleta","","","","",""],"head_icon":"311401.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["看来我只能度过整整两天的空窗期，对着我还未完成的结局唉声叹气……","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/bangongshihunan.jpg","choice":[]},"120":{"step":[[120,121,""]],"type":1,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["她单手捂着胸口，像一个被遗忘在旷野上的孤独骑士。对此，亨廷感到有些为难。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/bangongshihunan.jpg","choice":[]},"121":{"step":[[121,122,""]],"type":1,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["她略作沉思了一会儿。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/bangongshihunan.jpg","choice":[]},"122":{"step":[[122,123,""]],"type":1,"name":["编辑亨廷","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"523801.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["明天晚上八点以后，我会有一段很自由的时间。一般来说，这段时间我会听听音乐，以普通读者的身份翻阅些愉快的书。但如果要招待客人，就另当别论了。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/bangongshihunan.jpg","choice":[]},"123":{"step":[[123,124,""]],"type":1,"name":["虚构集","","Recoleta","","","","",""],"head_icon":"311401.png","audio":"","boo